{"reviewId": "306739280_89vxtI56P", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "太阳黑子活动量利好农业产量。难怪，2026年是太阳黑子活动频繁的年份（包括有厄尔尼诺现象），中国这边经常刷到网上说河南的蒜薹产量过剩或许跟这个气候有关系？", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "20475-20569", "abstract": "即太阳黑子较多、活动频繁的时候，由于气候相对温暖湿润，大宗农产品产量往往增长，价格加速下跌；而太阳黑子较少时，该段时间内农产品产量往往处于低点，价格有上扬趋势（见图1-21至图1-24）。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "306739280_89vxtI56P", "userVid": 306739280, "topics": [], "createTime": 1780206855, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 306739280, "name": "Jiayi", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/jOiccFykLdhSbLwaDq9cVbArwDT4ae6WxIDZCcbh9kGb94hkuDJOCQ41KicvSfjfMddllYk5V87Iqj8LQhtslq2WBnIIQUdpAiajCicyaho7icv4/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Jiayi", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}, "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"reviewId": "306739280_89vxtI56P", "content": "种植户多了，也就过剩了，边际效用递减", "commentId": "306739280_89vxtI56P_c14871668_8aCq5cCkd", "userVid": 14871668, "createTime": 1784119296, "author": {"userVid": 14871668, "name": "魏月贝", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTI7jWAwBhicqoLq8ibBY6djBLMduZIprITujTL0lQFxVOibxOlvMkkCZwOkRLblHCib25P3VPZ83FwdIg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "meda